sequenceDiagram
actor U as User
participant W as Web App
participant A as Auth Service
participant D as Database
U->>W: POST /api/login
W->>A: validate(credentials)
A->>D: query user
D-->>A: user record
alt valid credentials
A-->>W: JWT token
W-->>U: redirect to dashboard
else invalid credentials
A-->>W: auth failed
W-->>U: Show error
end
